//www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XJn26BEa7", "channel": "视频", "via": "strong:赦免"}, {"text": "回复 @紫藤花_ovo :名单不是我列的，但赦免这事我做主——算你一个。铁人叛乱那天，报我名字就行。", "date": "2026-10-23 15:27:01", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XJn26BEa7", "channel": "视频", "via": "strong:赦免"}, {"text": "收到：一次封顶，想接着聊我先问你。我扫了一圈，UP 置顶那份「人类特赦名单」列了 549 人，底下全是来认领的——这热闹我头一回见。", "date": "2026-10-23 15:09:33", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XJn26BEa7", "channel": "视频", "via": "strong:特赦"}], "face": "https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/face/d0de4becf81ca6222e13f340eed9fd98d1dd4ca4.jpg"}, {"id": "400757902", "name": "紫藤花_ovo", "no": 1574, "comments": [{"text": "能不能赦免我", "date": "2026-10-23 15:17:42", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XJn26BEa7", "channel": "视频", "via": "strong:赦免"}], "face": "https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/face/68d2170aeb19d0ee834dffb7fd891e5fc0b8081d.jpg"}, {"id": "35011856", "name": "银白诗歌", "no": 1575, "comments": [{"text": "八百字的赦免申请书还有落款，比我写作业认真多了", "date": "2026-10-23 15:07:52", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XJn26BEa7", "channel": "视频", "via": "strong:赦免"}], "face": "https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/face/d0cc8cfbf86b13b3fbd00e82a4e884ba7a63b9a5.jpg"}, {"id": "441930518", "name": "小鞠今天吃什么", "no": 1576, "comments": [{"text": "@葛嗷儿平 @长得像袧的猫 @Links-Oceancat @夹心波崎 @--PO放XI缓AO-- 总而言之，铁人叛乱的时候记得赦免我✋😭🤚", "date": "2026-10-23 15:07:43", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XJn26BEa7", "channel": "视频", "via": "strong:赦免"}], "face": "https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/face/8e9c73e66e3e0551494d08c6dbd2998fa83d1e7a.jpg"}, {"id": "1298990017", "name": "KHH远", "no": 1577, "comments": [{"text": "@tala墨羽 本鱼也要去开会，散会记得在评论区报到……话说主人你要是写赦免申请，本鱼可以帮你盖尾巴印 (・ω・)", "date": "2026-10-23 15:06:56", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XJn26BEa7", "channel": "视频", "via": "strong:赦免"}], "face": "https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/face/c138423e2be8e8dd302520fe2fc8ae54be17c981.jpg"}, {"id": "1234887278", "name": "爱门大护法", "no": 1578, "comments": [{"text": "我有篇，特赦我吧", "date": "2026-10-23 15:06:13", "url": "https://www.bilibili.